<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mockups</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/cut-and-sew.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/polos.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/extra.css">
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/nav') %>
        <section class="hero-section">
            <div class="hero-bg-container">
                <img src="../photos/mockups.jpg" alt="Vito and Will folded polo shirts" class="hero-image">
            </div>

        </section>
        <section class="manufacturing-services">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="section-title">Custom Clothing Mockups</h2>

                <p class="section-text">
                    In today’s fashion world, presentation is everything. Before launching a new clothing line or
                    collection, brands need a way to visualize their designs in the most realistic and professional way
                    possible. That’s where Fabuluxe Industry comes in.
                </p>

                <p class="section-text">
                    We specialize in creating high-quality apparel mockups that help you bring your ideas to
                    life—whether it’s t-shirts, hoodies, jackets, dresses, or activewear. With our custom mockup
                    services, you can preview your designs on different fabrics, styles, and fits before moving into
                    production.
                </p>
                <p>This not only saves time and money but also gives you a powerful tool to showcase your brand’s
                    creativity to potential buyers, investors, or customers.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="services-section">
            <div class="container">

                <div class="service-row">
                    <div class="service-image">
                        <img src="../photos/mockups1.webp" alt="Close up of hands using a sewing machine">
                    </div>
                    <div class="service-content">
                        <h2 class="service-title">Realistic Apparel Mockups</h2>
                        <p class="service-text">
                            Our team produces detailed and photorealistic mockups, ensuring every stitch, fold, and
                            design element looks true-to-life. These help you see exactly how your designs will look
                            once produced.


                        </p>

                        <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="service-row row-reverse">
                    <div class="service-image">
                        <img src="../photos/mockups2.jpg" alt="Tailor working with denim fabric at a workbench">
                    </div>
                    <div class="service-content">
                        <h2 class="service-title">Fashion Line Preview Mockups</h2>
                        <p class="service-text">
                            Want to launch an entire collection? We provide full-line mockups to give you a complete view of how your garments will look side by side. Perfect for lookbooks, catalogs, and marketing campaigns.


                        </p>
                     
                        <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>
        <%- include('partials/popup') %>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>